{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is seen, move and take it. If reached, process it. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
